  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CARE Danmark - NGO call Sahel - 2021-2024 - The Central Sahel region communities are more food secure and resilient to climate change and live a life free from violence.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant awarded to CARE Denmarks project: Responding to Emergency Needs in a Long-term Perspective (RENLOP).

The project aims to contribute to Central Sahel region communities are more food secure and resilient to climate change and live a life free from violence. This stated goal is measured by % of people targeted by the project better able to build resilience to the effects of climate change and variability.</narrative>
  </description>
